  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi></math>&nbsp;is a tautology and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>So,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> will be a tautology.</p>"
